<title>UK: Woolwich adds 100 mln stg to seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Woolwich adds 100 mln stg to seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolwich Plc's August 2004 FRN has been increased by 100 million stg to 350 million stg, lead manager BZW said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new paper was priced at 99.905.</p>
<p>The deal was originally launched on July 21 at 99.905.  </p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN STG   BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    12.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +3.125 BP PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	ISS PRICE  99.905    LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA A1/AA-    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
